  "tillverkar_beskrivning": {
    "text": "Italia is a awning for window and balcony which is used for shading of windows, shop windows, verandas and balconies. In sunny days this construction can protect your house from direct sunlight. Framework is made of aluminum profile. Arms are equipped with special spring which protects arms against folding under heavy wind pressure. Fabric is tensioned by the spring. Weight the of the awning is equally distributed between brackets, that means system \"Italia\" in cassette can be installed even in the places where there cannot be used terrace awning with folding arms. The light weight of the awning facilitates the installation. The construction can be installed on almost any kind of window or opening. System is coated with powder lacquer of the snow-white color. Construction made from extruded aluminium. Easy installation thanks to separately mounted brackets and arms. Spring in the arms tightens the fabric and prevents the arms from folding under wind pressure. Easy operation with the use of full automatic.",
